[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892201\">7040H42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892192\">7040G40</a>\n                                           (left\nside only)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892183\">7040B18</a></p><p>1. Remove the embellishment.</p><p>2. Undo and remove the relay mechanism.</p><p>3. Undo the bolt.</p><p>4. Remove the pillar trim from the internal retainers using the\nappropriate tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.878.077.000</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the trim is undamaged.</p><p>1. Fit the trim on the internal retainers.</p><p>2. Tighten the bolt.</p><p>3. Tighten the bolt securing the seat belt relay mechanism.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR SEAT BELT IDLER..</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.7 - 5.3</p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Fit the embellishment.</p>"],[3,63,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2892183\">7040B18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892192\">7040G40</a>\n                                           (left\nside only)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892201\">7040H42</a></p>"]]